# @name login
POST http://localhost:8001/api/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ahmetcan", "password": "12345" }

### 1) CastError: geçersiz id biçimi
GET http://localhost:8001/api/notes/123

### 2) ValidationError: içerik 5 karakterden kısa
POST http://localhost:8001/api/notes HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "content": "abc" }

### 3) E11000: aynı kullanıcı adı ikinci kez
POST http://localhost:8001/api/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ahmetcan", "name": "kopya", "password": "12345" }

### 4) JsonWebTokenError: bozuk token
POST http://localhost:8001/api/notes HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer abc

{ "content": "hata denemesi" }

### 5) TokenExpiredError: süresi dolmuş token
POST http://localhost:8001/api/notes HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "content": "süre denemesi" }

### 6) Hiçbir dala uymayan hata: şifre yok
POST http://localhost:8001/api/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "sifresiz", "name": "deneme" }